            "ref_text": "- component->neuron.\n- The notation in 2.2 can be simplifed drastically. I recommend authors to assume fully connected layer and discuss convolutional layers in appendix.",
            "test_text": "- CLAR: The figures are generally well-labeled and effectively illustrate the key claims, such as the speed-up in learning curves and the reduction in parameter similarity. Evidence anchors: SRC-005, SRC-010."
